SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The tthhrr__nneeww() system call is non-standard and is used by the 1:1
     Threading Library (libthr, -lthr) to implement IEEE Std 1003.1-2001
     (“POSIX.1”) pthread(3) functionality.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The tthhrr__nneeww() system call first appeared in FreeBSD 5.2.

